WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.335
-Here's what people
are talking about.

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.669
Some big political news.

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:05.805
Today President Trump
went on Twitter and announced

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.540
that he is banning
transgender people

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.308
from serving in the military.

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:11.277
[ Audience boos ]

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:12.945
This guy.

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:15.048
Trump said he understands
this is a very sensitive issue,

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:18.017
so he made sure to choose
his emojis very carefully.

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.352
Uh...

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:22.789
[ Applause ]

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.692
Actually, Trump says that
he's banning transgender people

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.895
from serving because
of high medical costs.

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.863
If he cares so much
about high medical costs,

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:33.165
maybe he should pass
a health-care bill.

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:35.401
Come on. What is he...

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:36.936
If he cares so much --

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.238
My God.

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:41.307
And Trump was talking
to reporters yesterday

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.576
after the big health-care vote,
and people noticed

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:48.013
that he didn't seem to know
how many senators there are.

00:00:48.013 --> 00:00:50.350
When told it's two
for each state, Trump said,

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.152
"I'm going to need
another clue.

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:55.388
I -- 15?"

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.857
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:59.626
Of course, another big story
is Trump's feud

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:01.927
with Attorney General
Jeff Sessions.

00:01:01.927 --> 00:01:03.963
And when he was asked
what will happen to Sessions,

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:06.966
Trump said, "Time will tell."

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.668
When asked if he was
just stealing lines

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:12.238
if his Magic 8-Ball,
Trump said, "Ask again later."

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.806
No. Wait. This is all...

00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:16.376
[ Applause ]

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:18.378
-Whoa.

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:19.912
-Meanwhile
the State Department says

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:22.081
Secretary of State
Rex Tillerson is

00:01:22.081 --> 00:01:24.783
"taking a little time off."

00:01:24.783 --> 00:01:27.587
Wow. Tillerson, Spicer,
maybe Sessions.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:28.887
You know things are bad
when the White House

00:01:28.887 --> 00:01:31.291
is losing more characters
than "Game of Thrones."

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.459
You know,
this is a lot of people.

00:01:33.459 --> 00:01:36.328
[ Applause ]

00:01:36.328 --> 00:01:38.731
And Trump held a big rally
in Ohio last night.

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.800
And I saw that
he rubbed Melania's back

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.235
while she was introducing him.

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:44.503
It was the first time
someone has ever shivered

00:01:44.503 --> 00:01:46.039
in 80-degree weather.

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:48.407
It is just -- It's kind of warm.

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:51.410
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.013
That's right. Trump gave
a speech in Youngstown, Ohio.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.414
And everyone is talking about

00:01:55.414 --> 00:01:57.116
a pretty big comparison
that he made.

00:01:57.116 --> 00:01:58.284
Take a look at this.

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:00.152
With the exception

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:03.556
of the late, great
Abraham Lincoln,

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:06.092
I can be more presidential

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:09.261
than any President that's
ever held this office.

00:02:09.261 --> 00:02:10.897
That I can tell you.

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:12.932
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:14.934
[ Audience boos ]

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:17.803
Then he said,
"I won't be, but I can."

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:20.306
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:22.741 --> 00:02:25.778
After watching Trump's speech,
CNN's Ana Navarro made

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:28.280
a pretty interesting comparison
of her own. Watch this.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:31.717 align:start position:0%
Guys, I've never done
hallucinogenic mushrooms,

00:02:31.717 --> 00:02:34.053 align:start position:0%
but when I watch one of
these Trump rally speeches,

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:36.355 size:72% position:36%
I feel, "Okay, this
is what it must be like

00:02:36.355 --> 00:02:39.125 size:81% position:41%
to be high on
hallucinogenic mushrooms."

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:41.427
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:44.497
-Yeah.

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:48.001
When Wolf Blitzer heard that,
he was like,

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.735
"Just tell me what you need
and how much."

00:02:49.735 --> 00:02:51.904
And you go, "Wait. Wait."

00:02:51.904 --> 00:02:54.907
And Trump's new communications
director, Anthony Scaramucci,

00:02:54.907 --> 00:02:57.110
addressed all the leaks
that have been coming out

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:59.845
and asked staffers, "You want to
sell postcards to the tourists

00:02:59.845 --> 00:03:02.181
or you want to work
in the West Wing?"

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:03.616
And the staffers said,

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:06.152
"Wait. Is that postcard thing
a real option or...?

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:09.689
I love postcards."

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.991
But as I mentioned earlier,
Trump has decided to ban

00:03:11.991 --> 00:03:14.160
transgender people from
serving in the military.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.829
It's very controversial,
so here to address this issue

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:19.399
is "Tonight Show" correspondent
Patti Harrison.

00:03:19.399 --> 00:03:21.701 line:0%
Patti, thank you for joining us.

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:24.937 line:0%
-Thank you.

00:03:24.937 --> 00:03:26.305 line:0%
Thanks for having me.

00:03:26.305 --> 00:03:28.607
Now, Jimmy,
I'm a transgender woman.

00:03:28.607 --> 00:03:29.809
And as a transperson,

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:32.644
it's hard to articulate
exactly how I feel.

00:03:32.644 --> 00:03:35.547
But I guess if I had to
describe it, I'd say,

00:03:35.547 --> 00:03:37.984
"Donald, you're so stupid.

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:41.054
You are so stupid.

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:42.821
You're lucky you're so hot."

00:03:42.821 --> 00:03:44.356
-Wait a second.

00:03:44.356 --> 00:03:45.691
[ Laughs ]

00:03:45.691 --> 00:03:47.226
"Lucky you're so hot."

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:50.029
Patti, when did you first hear
about Trump's decision?

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:52.164
-Well, when I saw
the headline this morning,

00:03:52.164 --> 00:03:54.066
at first, I just read,

00:03:54.066 --> 00:03:56.034
"Donald Trump bans
transgender people."

00:03:56.034 --> 00:03:59.038
And I was like,
"Yeah, that sounds like him."

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:01.740
But then I realized
it was just in the military,

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:05.545
and I was shocked because
I assumed he already did that.

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:07.246
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.246 --> 00:04:10.082
Now, I don't necessarily want
to serve in the military,

00:04:10.082 --> 00:04:12.118
but I want the right to serve.

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:15.153
You know, it's like I don't
want to go to your baby shower,

00:04:15.153 --> 00:04:16.856
but I want the invite.

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:19.892
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:22.295
But, you know,
I don't even think Trump knows

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:24.163
what transgender means.

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:25.665
He probably thinks
transgender people

00:04:25.665 --> 00:04:28.000
are those cars
that turn into robots.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.269
-Yeah. It might be --
It might be so.

00:04:30.269 --> 00:04:31.704
Patti, before you go,

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:33.473
do you have any final thoughts
about all of this?

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:34.907
-Well, first, I want to say

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:37.743
that there are amazingly brave
transpeople

00:04:37.743 --> 00:04:39.478
who should be allowed to serve,

00:04:39.478 --> 00:04:41.747
like Kristin Beck,
a retired Navy SEAL

00:04:41.747 --> 00:04:44.183
with a Purple Heart,
Bronze Star,

00:04:44.183 --> 00:04:45.851
and countless service medals.

00:04:45.851 --> 00:04:47.887
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:52.025 --> 00:04:53.358
Yeah.

00:04:53.358 --> 00:04:55.961
And yet Trump says transgender
people in the military

00:04:55.961 --> 00:04:58.063
would be
a tremendous disruption.

00:04:58.063 --> 00:04:59.399
And I get it.

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:01.534
If you constantly
draw attention to yourself,

00:05:01.534 --> 00:05:03.302
spend all day
distracting everyone,

00:05:03.302 --> 00:05:05.104
and cost taxpayers
millions of dollars,

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:07.072
the perfect job for you
isn't the military.

00:05:07.072 --> 00:05:09.242
It's the president
of the United States.

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:12.278
-Thank you very much.
Patti Harrison, everybody.

00:05:12.278 --> 00:05:13.546
Thank you, Patti.

00:05:13.546 --> 00:05:15.281
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:20.353
"You're lucky you're hot."

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:21.987
That's a -- Yeah, yeah.

00:05:21.987 --> 00:05:23.756
Here's a local story,
you guys, here.

00:05:23.756 --> 00:05:27.426
The MTA wants to improve
the subway here in New York

00:05:27.426 --> 00:05:32.297
by removing seats from trains
to fit more people.

00:05:32.297 --> 00:05:34.867
And after that, they're
going to ask riders to lie down

00:05:34.867 --> 00:05:37.670
and spoon each other so they
can pack even more inside.

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:41.407
Like, I'll be the inner spoon?

00:05:41.407 --> 00:05:43.542
That's right.
The MTA wants to remove seats

00:05:43.542 --> 00:05:45.311
from trains to fit more people.

00:05:45.311 --> 00:05:47.379
Even worse, Southwest Airlines
heard that and said,

00:05:47.379 --> 00:05:49.015
"That's a great idea.
Can we do that?"

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:52.351
And you go, "No.
You can't do that on a plane."

00:05:52.351 --> 00:05:54.120
And finally,
I saw that a woman in Texas

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.723
bought a $300 vacuum from Target

00:05:56.723 --> 00:05:58.624
but got home and realized
the box contained

00:05:58.624 --> 00:06:02.895
dirty towels, rocks,
and a can of chili...

00:06:02.895 --> 00:06:05.264
or, as that's known over
at Walmart, a gift basket.

00:06:05.264 --> 00:06:07.232
There you guys go.
We have a great show tonight.

00:06:07.232 --> 00:06:08.534
Give it up for The Roots!

